<section image-layout="blank" id="S7kA6Fw8A7"><grid spacing="none"><grid-item id="5xbfU-slo-"><labels><label variant="solid">REQUEST · LIVE TRACE</label><label variant="outline">ILLUSTRATIVE TEST RUN</label></labels><h2>Prove it live, then break it safely</h2><p>Trace response, cookie, redirect and protected route together—authenticate once; authorize at every boundary.</p><grid spacing="small" vertical-sizing="hug"><grid-item id="Lw8iOysM7x" background-color="palette-3" padding="8pt 12pt" colspan="20"><p role="eyebrow">AUTHENTICATION</p><h4>Who is this?</h4><p font-size="sm">Valid login creates server-side state.</p></grid-item><grid-item id="tcwKC-ZvYF" background-color="surface" padding="8pt 12pt" colspan="20"><p role="eyebrow"><span text-color="palette-2">AUTHORIZATION</span></p><h4>Authenticated ≠ authorized</h4><p font-size="sm"><code>/admin</code> still returns 403 for a student.</p></grid-item><grid-item id="FBJopVqet9" cell-style="subtle" padding="8pt 12pt" colspan="20"><p role="eyebrow">LOGOUT PROOF</p><h4>Replay fails</h4><p font-size="sm">Destroy server state—not just the cookie.</p></grid-item></grid><grid spacing="none" vertical-sizing="hug"><grid-item id="8jbPHEOxWk" background-color="surface" padding="4pt 10pt" colspan="30"><p font-size="sm">authentication-lab · observable outcomes</p></grid-item><grid-item id="Z7A80L7lW7" background-color="surface" align="right" padding="4pt 10pt" colspan="30"><p font-size="sm">HTTPS · local teaching environment</p></grid-item></grid><table col-widths="[13,28,59]" header-row="true" borders="rows" striped="false" style="--table-cell-padding: 2pt 8pt; --table-radius: 0;"><tr><th>HTTP</th><th>Probe</th><th>Expected evidence</th></tr><tr><td><b>401</b></td><td>Wrong credentials</td><td>Generic failure; no authenticated session.</td></tr><tr><td background-color="palette-3"><b>303</b></td><td>Valid credentials</td><td>New opaque <code>sid</code>; redirect to <code>/dashboard</code>.</td></tr><tr><td background-color="palette-3"><b>200</b></td><td>Refresh <code>/dashboard</code></td><td><code>requireAuth</code> resolves server-side state.</td></tr><tr><td background-color="surface"><span text-color="palette-2"><b>403</b></span></td><td>Open <code>/admin</code> as student</td><td>Role gate denies access after authentication.</td></tr><tr><td><b>303 → 401</b></td><td>Logout; replay old <code>sid</code></td><td>Server state is destroyed; the old identifier is rejected.</td></tr></table></grid-item></grid></section>